id=a52sxq_tethering
name=Galaxy A52s 5G netbpfload kernel 5.4 gate
author=kusti420
description=Google's Tethering APEX netbpfload refuses kernels < 5.10 (25Q4) / 5.15 (26Q4) and its services have reboot_on_failure -> bootloop. Run a copy with those two gates branched over (5.4 floor kept) from /system, keeping Google's signed APEX (IchthysOS-built modules carry SDK codename "Baklava" and are rejected by REL builds).
